:2},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants, Seafood","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"VaO-VW3e1kARkU9bP1E7Fw","review_id":"G-AUfkUdFYRdmScgil_Xrg","date":"2014-12-18T16:56:00","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9575000405311584,"text_excerpt":"I had asked a few locals about their favorite place to get oysters, and they all said to head on over to Felix's. I had just gone to Acme's a few hours before I came here, so I feel like I was able to compare the two places fairly well. I came here with my mom, and we ordered a dozen raw oysters, a half dozen chargrilled oysters, red beans and rice, the fried crawfish tails, and the deluxe Bloody Mary. I enjoyed the Bloody Mary as it came with an oyster, a shrimp, and pickled green beans. (The oyster and the shrimp is what made this \"deluxe\". It was overall a good Bloody Mary. The raw oysters that our waitress brought out to us were HUGE. Some of them were as big as the palm of my hand, a..."},{"business_id":"VaO-VW3e1kARkU9bP1E7Fw","review_id":"tn3r3YhSIkvBQprOO_kGdw","date":"2018-11-28T00:56:36","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9550454616546631,"text_excerpt":"Our first meal in NOLA was across the street at Acme Oyster House. We really enjoyed it and really wanted to have some Chargrilled oysters again before leaving. So on our last day, we decided to stop by Felix's Oyster Bar and fulfill that craving! We went with a dozen Chargrilled Oysters and a 1/2 Po Boy and Side of Etoufee. The Chargrilled oysters were delicious as expected! Grilled and topped with butter and herbs, soaked up in the loaf of bread. Delicious!!! 1/2 Shrimp po boy with a side of Etoufee was good. I really got this because I wanted to have a po boy in NOLA before leaving and Killer Po Boy was closed (on Tuesdays). It was good but nothing super special. Our server was friendl..."},{"business_id":"VaO-VW3e1kARkU9bP1E7Fw","review_id":"9QYNUAURZKX2XcBK2GpjGQ","date":"2015-12-11T17:07:50","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9545047283172607,"text_excerpt":"I have been to Acme a couple of times in the past, but this time the BF suggested we eat at Felix's. I do like oysters and he said they had the best so off we go. First off, they often have a line at this joint but usually not as bad as Acme across the street. But time your visit in between meal times for the shortest wait. We were seated pretty much immediately, although at the bar. But since it was just the two of us, it was not a biggie. This place is not fancy, but it doesn't have to be. It is a place to grub down on some good seafood. I started with a cup of the seafood gumbo because I was hungover and hot soup sounded life restoring. It was really good gumbo so I was pleased. But th..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"VaO-VW3e1kARkU9bP1E7Fw","photo_id":"Jf5xr2pwbyC2nY_AZn4HVw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/Jf5xr2pwbyC2nY_AZn4HVw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8187474012374878},{"business_id":"VaO-VW3e1kARkU9bP1E7Fw","photo_id":"-Fg9hL_kvChL-3JMLUC95g","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/-Fg9hL_kvChL-3JMLUC95g.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8178007006645203},{"business_id":"VaO-VW3e1kARkU9bP1E7Fw","photo_id":"UEqhHs_r5ahnECxQUltxhw","